   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHK F&#xe4;ltrepresentation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Svenska Helsingforskommitt&#xe9;n f&#xf6;r f&#xe4;ltrepresentation i Kosovo. Representationen f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;s best&#xe5; av en person, placerad i Belgrad med bevakningsuppdrag f&#xf6;r hela FRY och angr&#xe4;nsande l&#xe4;nder. D&#xe5; projektet inte kunde p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjas i tid har det f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngts till 24 m&#xe5;nader t o m december 2001. Projektsumman &#xe4;r 1 636 500.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Swedish Helsinki Committee for a Field Representative Ofiice in the Balkans. The person will be placed in Belgrade to cover the FRY and the region. Since the project could not start on time, the project time has been expanded to 24 months, up to December 2001. The project amount is SEK 1 636 500.</narrative>
  </description>
